    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Chat Completions\n\nSends the conversation as `messages` to a deployed service and streams the assistant reply into this chat.\n\n1. **Get Chat History** loads prior turns for this chat (empty on the first message).\n2. **Build Messages** appends the new user message.\n3. **Haystack Enterprise AI** runs Chat Completions. **Stream** is on so tokens show up live.\n4. **Insert Chat** writes the user and assistant turns into **Simple Memory** so the next message includes them.\n\nFill in your workspace and service, plus Haystack Enterprise API credentials.\n\nThe `sessionId` on the chat webhook is n8n's own chat session — it only keys Simple Memory. It is not sent to Haystack Enterprise.\n\nThe browser network tab shows n8n's chat webhook (`/webhook-test/...` or `/webhook/...`). The Haystack Enterprise call is made from the n8n server; open the **Build Messages** or **Haystack Enterprise AI** node's execution to see the `messages` array that was sent.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "f7a8b9c0-0005-4f7f-9f7f-000000000005",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1120, 280]
    }
  ],
